	(gr_text "WakeBand flex rev A, layout hand-off (step 8). Unfolded view, all parts top side.\nPod about 22 x 40 mm. Island A 36 x 18, island B 36 x 20; the 30 mm cell bay ends 0.5 mm before the antenna shadow.\nStackup: 2-layer adhesiveless PI 25 um, 18 um Cu, coverlay, ENIG, about 0.12 mm.\nStiffeners on the bottom (User.2): FR4 0.4 under island A and the LRA pad, PI 0.2 behind the dock pads.\nNo steel stiffeners. Bend zone (User.3): no vias or parts, R >= 1.2 mm.\nNeck 7 mm wide x 8 mm long. Vias only on stiffened areas, >= 0.5 mm from a stiffener edge. Trace/space >= 0.1 mm.\nConfirm with JLCPCB which User layers they read for stiffeners before ordering."
		(at 96 123 0)
		(layer "Dwgs.User")
		(uuid "5e48a434-36b9-455d-a7ab-a0e47f3df408")
		(effects
